                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In avrocat.c, function process_file, the return value of avro_value_to_json is not checked, so if the JSON conversion fails, a free of the char *json will occur.<br/>
<br/>
I have attached a patch to check the return value and print an error.
  </td>
