                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Users who want to use a different representation of json from the JsonEncoder are forced to re-implement all of it since JsonEncoder&#39;s internals are all private. For example I wanted to make the json not contain type hints for unions.  That required only overriding one method after this fix.<br/>
<br/>
To fix this making things protected will allow users to change just code that is needed. 
