</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        FLUME-1028                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Use of avro-maven-plugin breaks multimodule projects since it forces the dependency resolution of all of the dependencies, some of which may be from within the reactor and not yet installed in the local cache.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
