                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It is effectively impossible to use a non-default velocity template for Avro compilation via the Maven plugin because the plugin&#39;s classloader only gives you access to its classpath and its dependencies classpath.<br/>
<br/>
This can be fixed by adding more resource loaders to Velocity in AvroCompiler.java.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll update this with a patch soon.<br/>

