</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The file unittest.cc fails to compile because the compiler gets confused about the overloaded function readFixed&lt;N&gt; in Parser class. There are two overloaded functions with the name readFixed, both templates taking size_t as template arguments. When the template argument is passed explicitly, the Mac compiler is not able to resolve the overload. The forthcoming patch addresses that issue. 
  </td>
