                <tr id="issuerow12604212" rel="12604212" data-issuekey="AVRO-1142" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1142" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1142">AVRO-1142</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Specification is misleading in regards to CRC32 checksum of Snappy blocks
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martin Nagy
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martin Nagy
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Aug/12 13:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Sep/12 21:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Sep/12 21:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        spec            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The specification says:<br/>
<br/>
??Each compressed block is followed by its 4-byte, big-endian CRC32 checksum.??<br/>
<br/>
This, in my opinion, suggests that the CRC32 checksum is calculated from the compressed block, when in fact it is computed from the block before compression (as it is implemented in java). I&#39;ve implemented a snappy codec for C++ and had trouble with this :(
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
