                <tr id="issuerow12606650" rel="12606650" data-issuekey="AVRO-1148" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1148" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1148">AVRO-1148</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SpecificData.java has a bug creating a schema for a map
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Amine R.
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Amine R.
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Sep/12 20:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Feb/13 18:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Feb/13 18:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.6.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1166                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Mac
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      in the SepcificData class, the protected Schema createSchema(java.lang.reflect.Type type, Map&lt;String,Schema&gt; names) fails in creating a schema for the Map type.<br/>
<br/>
Looking at this excerpt, <br/>
<br/>
else if (Map.class.isAssignableFrom(raw)) {   // map<br/>
        java.lang.reflect.Type key = params[0];<br/>
        java.lang.reflect.Type value = params[1];<br/>
        if (!(type instanceof Class<br/>
              &amp;&amp; CharSequence.class.isAssignableFrom((Class)type)))<br/>
          throw new AvroTypeException(&quot;Map key class not CharSequence: &quot;+key);<br/>
        return Schema.createMap(createSchema(value, names));<br/>
      }<br/>
<br/>
The type is a map, the key is a string. therefore instead of  &quot;if (!(type instanceof Class&quot; it should be &quot;if (!(key instanceof Class&quot;.<br/>

  </td>
