                                            <td class="description">      The configure method is being called twice on each AvroMapper instance. <br/>
<br/>
The first call is made via reflection, when the instance is created by ReflectionUtils, and the second is made explicitly inside HadoopMapper. I think this second one could be safely removed. <br/>
