                <tr id="issuerow12609469" rel="12609469" data-issuekey="AVRO-1175" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1175" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1175">AVRO-1175</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                BinaryData keeps a thread local reference after completing a compare, preventing compared arrays from being GC&#39;d
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sandy Ryza
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sandy Ryza
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Sep/12 23:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Dec/12 17:57 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Nov/12 22:56 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      BinaryData holds on to BinaryDecoders as thread local variables (so it doesn&#39;t have to make new ones for each compare?).  When a compare is completed, the BinaryDecoder still keeps a reference to the ByteArrayByteSource, which stops its underlying byte array from being garbage collected.<br/>
<br/>
This is causing an OutOfMemoryError in reducers when shuffling with MR2.
  </td>
