                                            <td class="environment">      linux, mac os
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      compileJsonSchemaFromString(std::string) is declared in the header, but not defined. Need to add<br/>
+AVRO_DECL ValidSchema compileJsonSchemaFromString(const std::string&amp; input)<br/>
+{<br/>
+  return compileJsonSchemaFromString(input.c_str());<br/>
+}<br/>
+<br/>
to the Compiler.cc or remove the prototype.
  </td>
