                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice to have [Dart|http://www.dartlang.org/] codegen and JSON encoding/decoding support.<br/>
<br/>
There has been some (unfinished) work on protobuf support for Dart: <br/>
http://code.google.com/p/dart/issues/detail?id=951 https://chromiumcodereview.appspot.com/user/Dan%20Rice https://chromiumcodereview.appspot.com/10595002/<br/>
<br/>
But there are no Dart implementations of Avro, as best I can determine. If anybody is aware of any, or interested in helping create one, please post here.
