                <tr id="issuerow12631242" rel="12631242" data-issuekey="AVRO-1243" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1243" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1243">AVRO-1243</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Avro support for all compression codecs
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Theodore michael Malaska
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Theodore michael Malaska
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Theodore michael Malaska
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Feb/13 12:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Feb/13 00:54 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Feb/13 23:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I may be reading this wrong but at this time org.apache.avro.file.CodecFactory only supports null, deflate, and snappy compression codecs.<br/>
<br/>
I would like to change the fromString method to use Class.forName(codec).newInstance(); after the codec was not found in the REGISTERED map but before the AvroRuntimeException is thrown. <br/>
<br/>
Here are some of my supporting thoughts<br/>
1. This should not interduce much slowness because it will only be called initialize.<br/>
2. This will allow for support for GZip, BZip2, and LZO with out adding more dependances to the maven pom file.<br/>
3. This will allow for a future Jiri I would like to do that would allow AvroOutputFormat to be able to use the following configs: mapred.output.compress and mapred.output.compression.codec<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
