                                            <td class="description">      It&#39;d be useful to have a Tool that uses appendAllFrom (with recompress set to false) to concatenate one or more of avro files to either another file or stdout. The Tool would fail if any input files had a different schema or metadata to ensure the tool doesn&#39;t try to decompress the contents.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve attached a patch that does this.
