                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is a more focused JIRA related to AVRO-1121.<br/>
<br/>
The goal of this JIRA is to:<br/>
1. Be able to set up a NettyServer that will accept compressed and uncompressed requests from clients.<br/>
2. Be able to set up NettyTranseiver that supports compression options.<br/>
<br/>
The initial design is to allow the compression to be an option at setup of the server or client and implement this compression with Netty&#39;s own ZLibEncoder and ZLibDecoder
  </td>
