                                            <td class="description">      Right now there are a Input and Output Format for the Map/Reduce mapred api but not for the mapreduce api.<br/>
<br/>
I will add that support in a new package called org.apache.trevni.avro.mapreduce in the trevni-avro package<br/>
<br/>
I will also attempt to move mapred formats to a new org.apache.trevni.avro.mapred package<br/>

