                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice when only RuntimeExceptions or other exceptions to extending SpecificExceptionBase would be logged at WARN level.<br/>
<br/>
Our log file is flooded with Exceptions extending SpecificExceptionBase but we want to log them in a different way to the &quot;unexpected&quot; exceptions.<br/>
<br/>
Maybe SpecificExceptionBase exceptions could be logged in a lower log level.
