                <tr id="issuerow12638613" rel="12638613" data-issuekey="AVRO-1283" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1283" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1283">AVRO-1283</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                remove static caches from GenericData, SpecificData and ReflectData
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Mar/13 23:13 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/17 15:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1277,                                                AVRO-1282                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently GenericData, ReflectData and SpecificData are often treated as singletons, through an instance returned by a static get() method.  Because of this, the caches they have must be thread-safe and are also memory leaks.<br/>
<br/>
Increasingly of late, new instances of these are allocated for use by a given DatumReader or DatumWriter.  This issue explores whether we can:<br/>
 - Change the static get() methods to always return new instances, so that each DatumReader and DatumWriter has its own instance.  Since DatumReader and DatumWriter are not thread-safe, the thread safety requirement could then be removed from caches, increasing their performance; and<br/>
 - Change caches to be non-static, to remove potential memory leaks.<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
