</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Copy-constructor for specific record builders: Builder(Builder other) does not copy the fields from builder &quot;other&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christophe Taton
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christophe Taton
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christophe Taton
    </td>
