                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      as discussed [on the mailing list|http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/avro-user/201304.mbox/%3CCALEq1Z-ncmjLjvCCLeEgm%2BQvMmPAg5%2B0pVW%3De1N-%3DxtQcMApPw%40mail.gmail.com%3E], the Python {{avro}} libraries don&#39;t support aliases.  (the string {{alias}} is found nowhere in the Python source code.<br/>
