                <tr id="issuerow12646398" rel="12646398" data-issuekey="AVRO-1324" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1324" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1324">AVRO-1324</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Avro-C: namespace lookup and inherited namespaces
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ben Walsh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ben Walsh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/May/13 11:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/May/13 16:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/May/13 13:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.4,                     1.7.5,                     1.8.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        c            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It seems that the C version of Avro doesn&#39;t resolve fully-qualified type names, and it doesn&#39;t<br/>
understand inherited namespaces.<br/>
<br/>
For example this doesn&#39;t work:<br/>
<br/>
{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;x&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Y&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
  {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;e&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Z&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
    {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;f&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;x.Z&quot;}<br/>
  ]}}<br/>
]}<br/>
<br/>
It can&#39;t find the type &quot;x.Z&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
(this is similar to a Ruby problem https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-635).<br/>

  </td>
