                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice to have the ability to add documentation for each symbol of an enum.<br/>
<br/>
Doung Cutting, quoted from the mailing list:<br/>
<br/>
Documentation per enum symbol is not currently supported, but would not be difficult to add.  Please file an issue in Jira if you&#39;d like to see this.  For compatibility, in Json, this would probably appear as a parallel array of documentation strings, e.g., something like:<br/>
<br/>
(&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Foo&quot;, &quot;type&quot;:&quot;enum&quot;, &quot;doc&quot;:&quot;an enum&quot;, &quot;symbols&quot;:[&quot;X&quot;,&quot;Y&quot;], &quot;symbols-doc&quot;:[&quot;X is X&quot;, &quot;Y is Y&quot;]}
  </td>
