                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When comparing two objects using GenericData.compare (directly or indirectly), null values in fields of record type objects are not sufficiently protected against, resulting in NPE<br/>
<br/>
e.g.<br/>
{code}<br/>
case ENUM:<br/>
  return s.getEnumOrdinal(o1.toString()) - s.getEnumOrdinal(o2.toString());<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This is prevalent throughout the {{compare}} method. This impacts {{compareTo}}, and {{equals}} implementations as well.
  </td>
