                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When compiling Avro with Hadoop 2.1.0-beta, met the following issue:<br/>
<br/>
[ERROR] COMPILATION ERROR : <br/>
[INFO] -------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
[ERROR] /var/lib/jenkins/jobs/IBM-Avro-1.7.4-review/workspace/lang/java/mapred/src/main/java/org/apache/avro/mapred/tether/TetheredProcess.java:[157,21] captureOutAndError(java.util.List&lt;java.lang.String&gt;,java.util.List&lt;java.lang.String&gt;,java.io.File,java.io.File,long,boolean) in org.apache.hadoop.mapred.TaskLog cannot be applied to (java.util.List&lt;java.lang.String&gt;,java.io.File,java.io.File,long)<br/>
<br/>
This is due to the removal of some deprecated org.apache.hadoop.mapred.TaskLog#captureOutAndError methods in Hadoop 2.1.0-beta:<br/>
<br/>
http://svn.apache.org/viewvc/hadoop/common/tags/release-2.0.4-alpha/hadoop-mapreduce-project/hadoop-mapreduce-client/hadoop-mapreduce-client-core/src/main/java/org/apache/hadoop/mapred/TaskLog.java?revision=1517377&amp;view=markup<br/>
