</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Example:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot;, &quot;date&quot;: &quot;true&quot;}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This is a valid, parseable schema, but in Python implementation:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; import avro.schema<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; sch = avro.schema.parse(&#39;{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot;, &quot;date&quot;: &quot;true&quot;}&#39;)<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; sch<br/>
&lt;avro.schema.PrimitiveSchema object at 0x0D071510&gt;<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; sch.props<br/>
{&#39;type&#39;: u&#39;long&#39;}<br/>
{code}
