    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1394" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1394">AVRO-1394</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Better error information when new record field has no default
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
