                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice if there was an annotation in org.apache.avro.reflect to specify default values for schemata derived reflectively, allowing for proper schema evolution.<br/>
<br/>
I suggest the following:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
@AvroDefault(1)<br/>
int someNum;<br/>
<br/>
@Nullable<br/>
@AvroDefault(null)<br/>
AnotherRecord myRec;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
