                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I encountered a bug in the Avro C API. If the following is done, it seems that the Avro data file reader can not read the file correctly<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
while (has values to write) {<br/>
	Open file for writing<br/>
	Write a value to the file<br/>
	Close the writer<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Reading this file with Avro data file reader fails with EOF after only the first item has been read from the file.
  </td>
