                                            <td class="description">      Start with an IDL like<br/>
<br/>
protocol Foo {<br/>
  record Bar {<br/>
    int x;<br/>
    int y = 0;<br/>
  }<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
Then use JsonDecoder to deserialize:<br/>
<br/>
{&quot;x&quot;:30}<br/>
<br/>
Bug: this fails because y is not provided.
