                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Although possible with SpecificData (schema generated classes), the ReflectData currently lacks a way to have a declaration such as {code}java.util.List&lt;String&gt; myList;{code} to be able to generate a nullable schema {code}{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;array&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: [&quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot;] }{code} instead of the current {code}{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;array&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: &quot;string&quot; }{code}<br/>
<br/>
There are {{@Union}} and {{@Nullable}} annotations available, but they cannot be applied to the above parameterised Collection declaration.
  </td>
