                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Symptom: Attempts to match reader = FIXED against writer != FIXED results in a RuntimeException (&quot;Unexpected schema type: FIXED&quot;), rather than an appropriate Symbol.ErrorAction.<br/>
<br/>
