                                            <td class="description">      Ideally, wherever a generic record builder is expected, one should be able to supply a builder for a specific record.<br/>
<br/>
That could happen by making SpecificRecordBuilderBase (and SpecificErrorBuilderBase?) a subclass of GenericRecordBuilder.<br/>
<br/>
Since SpecificRecordBase implements GenericRecord, it should be possible with minimal effort.<br/>

