                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to re-use the JSONDecoder to decode the JSONText file which contains JSONEncoded Objects. After first item is processed successfully, on the second item, when I tried to re-use the decoder, decoder crashes.<br/>
<br/>
The reason is when jsonDecoder is initialized with new stream, internal stack of jsonDecoder is getting reset and StreamReader of jsonDecoder is also not getting reset.<br/>
<br/>
Attached is the program to re-produce this issue and also I attach patch to fix this issue. But patch works but needs to be reviewed 
