                <tr id="issuerow12694025" rel="12694025" data-issuekey="AVRO-1454" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1454" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1454">AVRO-1454</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                AvroAsTextInput format creates invalid JSON for NaN values
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Antonio Piccolboni
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Antonio Piccolboni
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Feb/14 22:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Jul/14 20:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Mar/14 18:40 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The AvroAsTextInput format generates a record containing<br/>
<br/>
[omitted] , &quot;someName&quot;: NaN}<br/>
<br/>
A json parser chokes on that and it is not legal JSON AFAIK. In related issues AVRO-972 and AVRO-1290 it is resolved, for lack of a better option, to map the value NaN to the string &quot;NaN&quot;, which needs to be quoted in JSON. Our parser can handle that with no modifications, Java will parse such a string to the correct value using standard libraries.
  </td>
