                <tr id="issuerow12698132" rel="12698132" data-issuekey="AVRO-1471" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1471" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1471">AVRO-1471</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                avro-maven-plugin schema generation should use project.build.sourceEncoding for generated files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Eugene Mustaphin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eugene Mustaphin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eugene Mustaphin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Mar/14 18:51 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Jul/14 20:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Mar/14 19:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      MacOS 10.9
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      avro-maven-plugin generates java sources using system default encoding which is not good if maven project sources&#39; encoding is different (which is often true on OS with non-UTF-8 system encoding like OSX and Windows) as generated files encoding differs from the rest of the project sources.<br/>
<br/>
It would be great if avro-maven-plugin used the project.build.sourceEncoding property for generated sources.
  </td>
