                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve been working on an encoder for JavaScript.<br/>
From the other JavaScript implementations I&#39;ve seen out there, this one is different in that it supports all Avro types and not only works in node.js but also in the browser. Also the Java implementation is able to parse the resulting file formats.<br/>
I&#39;ve included examples. It&#39;s only able to encode, not decode yet.<br/>
<br/>
Maybe that&#39;s something worth including in future releases.<br/>
<br/>
http://www.speedyshare.com/CAwTj/avro-encoder.7z
