                <tr id="issuerow12701545" rel="12701545" data-issuekey="AVRO-1483" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1483" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1483">AVRO-1483</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Csharp library doesnt publicly expose way to create ArraySchema objects
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Patch Available
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nigel Longton
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nigel Longton
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Mar/14 18:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Mar/14 20:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        csharp            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In Java one can do Schema.createArray(AvroGeneratedClass.class) to allow for the raw encoding of arrays. In C# the ArraySchema class is internal only and so this doesn&#39;t work. Adding the following lines to ArraySchema.cs (as they exist in MapSchema.cs) fixes this.<br/>
        public static ArraySchema CreateArray(Schema type)<br/>
        {<br/>
            return new ArraySchema(type, null);<br/>
        }<br/>

  </td>
