  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If an exception is thrown during a request in a Java NettyServer, an InvalidCastException is thrown in Avro.ipc.Specific.SpecificRequestor.ReadError when it attempts to cast the string response to an Exception. <br/>
<br/>
An example response is &quot;java.lang.NullPointerException: null of com.foo.Bar&quot;<br/>
<br/>
I expect the ReadError code to support string errors and translate them to the correct C# equivalent.
