                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Sometimes you want to pass your Avro bean around to various systems in  your infrastructure and don&#39;t want anyone to alter the state of the bean. <br/>
<br/>
Currently one can prevent changes to various field by preventing the generation of setter methods but for array and map fields one can still get the array/map and perform mutating operations (i.e. add new element to the list).<br/>

