                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Writing records with the following schema fail when using the Reflect API:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
{<br/>
  &quot;type&quot; : &quot;record&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;name&quot; : &quot;simple_schema&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;namespace&quot; : &quot;com.foo.bar&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;fields&quot; : [ {<br/>
    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;foo&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;type&quot; : {<br/>
      &quot;type&quot; : &quot;fixed&quot;,<br/>
      &quot;name&quot; : &quot;bar&quot;,<br/>
      &quot;size&quot; : 2<br/>
    }<br/>
  }, {<br/>
    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;baz&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;type&quot; : [ &quot;null&quot;, &quot;bar&quot; ],<br/>
    &quot;default&quot; : null<br/>
  } ]<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
This was found by Harsh J Chouraria.
  </td>
