                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PrimitiveSchema class overrides WriteJson method to handle a shotrcut where primitive type is given as a literal, but in doing so it ignores teh case where there are custom properties attached to it. <br/>
This breaks any functionality which relies on the equality of the schema re-parsed from its ToString/WriteJson output, one example being csharp codegen.<br/>
<br/>
Example:<br/>
{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;logicalType&quot;:&quot;DateTimeInstant&quot;, &quot;logicalEncoding&quot;:&quot;ISO8601-datetime-offset&quot; }<br/>
<br/>
becomes &quot;type&quot; : &quot;string&quot;
  </td>
