                                            <td class="description">      At datafile.c:592, avro_set_error is called to indicate that the &quot;datum is too large for file block size&quot;. However, this may sometimes be incorrect, it is hiding any errors set in avro_write_data(), which includes things such as &quot;field is invalid&quot;, etc, which are arguably more correct errors to return to the user.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!
