</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1564" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1564">AVRO-1564</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unknown datum type exception while converting optional bytes using avro-thrift
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Michael Pershyn
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Pershyn
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Pershyn
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Aug/14 09:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Feb/16 14:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/14 19:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">3</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Very similar to AVRO-1500.<br/>
<br/>
When in thrift schema (e.g. {{Test}}) with optional byte field:<br/>
{code}<br/>
16: optional byte byteOptionalField<br/>
{code}<br/>
This field is initialized like:<br/>
{code}<br/>
test.setByteOptionalField((byte)4);<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Then during conversion of this thrift-object to avro instead of converting it to int 4, the exception is thrown.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
org.apache.avro.AvroRuntimeException: Unknown datum type java.lang.Byte: 4                                                                                                                                                                     <br/>
        at org.apache.avro.generic.GenericData.getSchemaName(GenericData.java:637)                                                                                                                                                             <br/>
        at org.apache.avro.thrift.ThriftData.getSchemaName(ThriftData.java:120)                                                                                                                                                                <br/>
        at org.apache.avro.generic.GenericData.resolveUnion(GenericData.java:602)                                                                                                                                                              <br/>
        at org.apache.avro.generic.GenericDatumWriter.resolveUnion(GenericDatumWriter.java:151)                                                                                                                                                <br/>
        at org.apache.avro.generic.GenericDatumWriter.write(GenericDatumWriter.java:71)                                                                                                                                                        <br/>
        at org.apache.avro.generic.GenericDatumWriter.writeField(GenericDatumWriter.java:114) <br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
----<br/>
<br/>
Proposed solution is also similar to AVRO-1500 - to overload {{getSchemaName}} in {{org.apache.avro.thrift.ThriftData}}
  </td>
