</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As noted in AVRO-1405, Avro C is still missing EOF in the case that the sync section ends exactly on a 4096 byte boundary (4096 bytes is the buffer size used by the reader).<br/>
<br/>
I have fixed this bug (the suggested fix for AVRO-1364 actually works fine). Also I added some more extensive testing.<br/>

