</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Unlike most of the avro tools tojson does not currently support reading from stdin. Adding this support would be quite conveniant. For example a pipe of concat and tojson is much easier to use that having to write a shell script to create a local file.<br/>
<br/>
Source code said that stdin is not supported because we need a seekable stream, however I believe this comment is outdated since it just works and other tools have no issue dealing with stdin.
