                <tr id="issuerow12742289" rel="12742289" data-issuekey="AVRO-1588" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1588" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1588">AVRO-1588</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ReflectData.AllowNull incorrectly handles primitive types.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Joey Echeverria
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Joey Echeverria
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Sep/14 21:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Sep/14 22:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Sep/14 22:30 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1589                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When doing the following:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
private static class PoJo {<br/>
  private long id;<br/>
  private String name;<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
ReflectData.AllowNull.get().getSchema(PoJo.class);<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;d expect a schema like this:<br/>
{code:javascript}<br/>
{<br/>
  &quot;type&quot; : &quot;record&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;name&quot; : &quot;PoJo&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;namespace&quot; : &quot;MyObject$&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;fields&quot; : [ {<br/>
    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;id&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;type&quot; : &quot;long&quot;,<br/>
  }, {<br/>
    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;name&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;type&quot; : [ &quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot; ],<br/>
    &quot;default&quot; : null<br/>
  } ]<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
But instead I get:<br/>
{code:javascript}<br/>
{<br/>
  &quot;type&quot; : &quot;record&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;name&quot; : &quot;PoJo&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;namespace&quot; : &quot;MyObject$&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;fields&quot; : [ {<br/>
    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;id&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;type&quot; : [ &quot;null&quot;, &quot;long&quot; ],<br/>
    &quot;default&quot; : null<br/>
  }, {<br/>
    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;name&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;type&quot; : [ &quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot; ],<br/>
    &quot;default&quot; : null<br/>
  } ]<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This will later result in an NullPointerException when you try to deserialize bytes where id was null when it tries to convert the Long to a long.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
