                                            <td class="environment">      windows-1252 encoding
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      encoding a multibyte UTF-8 code point such as:<br/>
<br/>
&quot;\xEF\xBD\x81&quot;<br/>
<br/>
Incorrectly becomes:<br/>
<br/>
&quot;\xEF\xBD\U0081&quot;<br/>
<br/>
When encoded in the service running in the windows-1252 locale.  This isn¹t a valid UTF-8 sequence so we end up with Mojibake when reading back the JSON encoded string.
  </td>
