                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When invoking GenericData.get().validate() with a union schema containing multiple record schemas an IndexOutOfBoundsException is possible.<br/>
<br/>
The exception results under the following conditions:<br/>
  1) Union contains multiple record schemas<br/>
  2) The first record schema in the union contains more fields than subsequentrecord schemas<br/>
  3) validate() is invoked with the union schema and a record of one of the<br/>
subsequent record schemas.<br/>

  </td>
