                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Clear all fields / Reset all fields to default value on Record template
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
