                <tr id="issuerow12773922" rel="12773922" data-issuekey="AVRO-1638" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1638" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1638">AVRO-1638</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SpecificDatumReader cannot read inner classes
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tycho Lamerigts
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tycho Lamerigts
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Feb/15 18:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Feb/15 19:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      After generating Specific classes from the attached avro file&#39;s schema, the file&#39;s content cannot be read by the following code.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
DatumReader&lt;Foo&gt; r = new SpecificDatumReader&lt;&gt;(Foo.class);<br/>
DataFileReader&lt;Foo&gt; fr = new DataFileReader&lt;&gt;(new File(&quot;foo.avro&quot;), r);<br/>
fr.next(); // this will throw<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
It appears to me that the logic in SpecificData#getClassName for dealing with names ending with &#39;$&#39; is incorrect, which causes avro to fall back to GenericDatumReader and ultimately fail.
