                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently JsonEncoder and JsonDecoder represent BYTES type as String encoded using ISO-8859-1 charset.<br/>
<br/>
It would be good to provide option to use base64 encoding (e.g. using jackson JsonGenerator.writeBinary(byte[] data, int offset, int len) method).<br/>

