<br/>
returns:<br/>
<br/>
{&#39;name&#39;: &#39;Type&#39;, &#39;symbols&#39;: (&#39;EVENTS&#39;, &#39;IMPRESS&#39;, &#39;LAYOUT&#39;), &#39;type&#39;: &#39;enum&#39;}<br/>
<br/>

