                <tr id="issuerow12846669" rel="12846669" data-issuekey="AVRO-1708" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1708" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1708">AVRO-1708</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Memory leak with WeakIdentityHashMap?
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Zoltan Farkas
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Zoltan Farkas
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jul/15 20:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/16 17:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Apr/16 01:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      WeakIdentityHashMap used in GenericDatumReader has only weak Keys, <br/>
it seems to grow, and values remain in map which looks like a memory leak...<br/>
<br/>
java WeakhashMap has Weak Entries which allows the GC to collect a entire entry, which prevents leaks...<br/>
<br/>
the javadoc of this class claims: &quot;Implements a combination of WeakHashMap and IdentityHashMap.&quot; which is not really the case
  </td>
