                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It is already possible to serialize Avro schema objects to JSON (avpr and avsc) format using the toString(boolean) method. However it would be nice to have a serialization option that serializes Avro schema objects to Avro IDL (avdl) format. This makes it possible to share Avro schema&#39;s in IDL format when using a code first approach and also make it possible to do round trip engineering, from IDL to Avro schema object and the other way around from Avro schema object to IDL.
  </td>
