                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi all -<br/>
<br/>
We noticed that accessing a field by an alias name on a GenericRecord (https://avro.apache.org/docs/1.7.6/api/java/org/apache/avro/generic/GenericRecord.html)  doesn&#39;t work on the current implementation of the Avro java package. <br/>
<br/>
Is this intended by design? We have some use cases where this is really useful and we were wondering if this something we could add to the avro package. <br/>
<br/>

