                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would nice to allow json ouput to be pretty printed. It&#39;s obviously possible to post-process, but that frequently re-orders which results in the problem described in AVRO-1636. In addition it obviously requires another pass through the data.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll attach a patch.
