                <tr id="issuerow12933165" rel="12933165" data-issuekey="AVRO-1787" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1787" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1787">AVRO-1787</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add support of directories &amp; globs to concat and cat
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Clément MATHIEU
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Clément MATHIEU
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Clément MATHIEU
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jan/16 20:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Jan/17 16:59 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Jan/17 16:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.9.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1909,                                                AVRO-1856                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      While answering [this question|http://stackoverflow.com/questions/34856838/concat-avro-files-using-avro-tools/34899425#34899425] on stack overflow, I noticed that the concat tool does not support directories or glob patterns as &quot;input-file&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
 OP&#39;s use case seems very valid but accepting only files as input push the burden on users.<br/>
<br/>
I think that it makes sense to also accept directories as input like cat does. Supporting glob patterns seems also useful if one want to concatenate the output of a MR job (in this case passing the directory won&#39;t work because of the {{_SUCESS}} file).<br/>
<br/>
I have quickly patched {{concat}} to support files, directories and glob patterns. Support of glob patterns has been added to {{cat}} since it seems useful too.<br/>
<br/>
This change should not introduce regression for users. But any feedback about glob patterns is welcome.
  </td>
