                <tr id="issuerow12938217" rel="12938217" data-issuekey="AVRO-1799" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1799" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1799">AVRO-1799</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java: GenericData.toString() mutates underlying ByteBuffer backed data
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Ryan Blue
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Greg McNutt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Greg McNutt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Feb/16 15:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Jan/17 11:26 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Feb/16 19:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.9.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1845,                                                AVRO-1832                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Around line 550, the writeEscapedString() method, used to serialize a byte array, will alter the underlying ByteBuffer&#39;s pointer.  Meaning subsequent uses of a toString()&#39;d avro object will yield different results.<br/>
<br/>
Need to not use a generic decode on a ByteBuffer; either clone the element (expensive), or iterate over the elements with an external index.
  </td>
