                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The problem is in the generated &#39;readExternal&#39; and &#39;writeExternal&#39; functions, because they do something like:<br/>
<br/>
WRITER$.write(this, org.apache.avro.specific.SpecificData.getEncoder(out));<br/>
<br/>
When a member variable called &#39;org&#39; exists, then the compile fails because the compiler thinks that &#39;org&#39; is a member variable and that &#39;apache cannot be resolved or is not a field&#39;. 
  </td>
