    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1869" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1869">AVRO-1869</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Decimal conversion from ByteBuffer ignores buffer position and limit
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Ryan Blue
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ryan Blue
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ryan Blue
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jun/16 03:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Jun/16 16:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Jun/16 16:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.0,                     1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The decimal conversion from a ByteBuffer currently copies the buffer contents into an array, but then calls {{array}} on the buffer and uses the buffer&#39;s internal array rather than the copied bytes. The result is that the constructed Decimal value uses whatever the buffer contained without using its position or limit.
  </td>
