                <tr id="issuerow12985675" rel="12985675" data-issuekey="AVRO-1873" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1873" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1873">AVRO-1873</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                avro gem doesn&#39;t compatible with other languages with snappy compression
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Ryan Blue
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pumsuk Cho
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pumsuk Cho
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Jun/16 08:15 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Sep/16 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Sep/16 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        ruby            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1885                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      CentOS 6.8 64bit, Snappy 1.1.0, Python 3.5, Ruby 2.2.3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve tested avro gem today, then found some weird result.<br/>
<br/>
With python library like &quot;fastavro&quot;, generated an avro file snappy compressed. This file works fine with avro-tools-1.8.1.jar.<br/>
<br/>
java -jar avro-tools-1.8.1.jar tojson testing.avro returns what I expected.<br/>
<br/>
But NOT compatible with ruby using avro gem returns &quot;Invalid Input&quot; message. And snappy compressed avro file made with avro gem doesn&#39;t work with avro-tools nor in python with avro-python3 and fastavro.<br/>
<br/>
my ruby codes are below:<br/>
<br/>
schema = Avro::Schema.paese(File.open(&#39;test.avsc&#39;, &#39;r&#39;).read)<br/>
avrofile = File.open(&#39;test.avro&#39;, &#39;wb&#39;)<br/>
writer = Avro::IO::DatumWriter.new(schema)<br/>
datawriter = Avro::DataFile::Writer.new file, writer, schema, &#39;snappy&#39;<br/>
datawriter&lt;&lt; {&quot;title&quot; =&gt; &quot;Avro&quot;, &quot;author&quot; =&gt; &quot;Apache Foundation&quot;}<br/>
datawriter.close<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
