                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Add a transient modifier to the conversions field as such<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
private final transient org.apache.avro.Conversion&lt;?&gt;[] conversions<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This will allow Serializers and type inference systems like Flink&#39;s TypeExtractor to not consider the {{conversions}} field and not try to serialize it.
