                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It looks like the check for correct marker bytes is incorrect.<br/>
<br/>
The check should validate both marker/version bytes match what is expected, but is instead this:<br/>
{code}<br/>
if (! (BinaryMessageEncoder.V1_HEADER[0] == header[0])<br/>
    &amp;&amp; BinaryMessageEncoder.V1_HEADER[1] == header[1]) { . . . }<br/>
{code}
