                                            <td class="description">      Given the schema<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
@namespace(&quot;fasdf&quot;)<br/>
protocol foo {<br/>
<br/>
    enum Domain {<br/>
        COM,<br/>
        ORG,<br/>
        BIZ,<br/>
        MIL<br/>
    }<br/>
<br/>
    record Wat {<br/>
        Domain domain = &quot;COM&quot;;<br/>
<br/>
        string foo = &quot;asfdasdf&quot;;<br/>
    }<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The resulting {{Wat}} Java class does not use the defined default values:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
@Test<br/>
    public void asdfasdf() throws Exception {<br/>
<br/>
        fasdf.Wat x = new Wat();<br/>
        System.out.print(x);<br/>
    }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This test results in:<br/>
{code}<br/>
{&quot;domain&quot;: null, &quot;foo&quot;: null}<br/>
{code}
