    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1900" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1900">AVRO-1900</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                build.sh test fails for dev-tools.jar
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Ryan Blue
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Suraj Acharya
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Suraj Acharya
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Aug/16 19:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Sep/16 17:20 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Sep/16 17:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.9.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">6</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1885,                                                AVRO-1887                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When i ran {{./build.sh test}} in the docker container I was getting an error mentioning dev-tools.jar was not present.<br/>
When I looked further into it I realized that {{build.sh}} never actually builds dev-tools.jar.<br/>
<br/>
I added a line in the test option to first {{mvn install}} on the dev-tools folder. 
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
