                                            <td class="description">      Similar to AVRO-1295 but for the C library. Namespace &quot;&quot; should be the NULL namespace when the schema is parsed. For example this breaks:<br/>
<br/>
```<br/>
{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;R&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
  {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;s&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;x&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Y&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
    {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;e&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Z&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
      {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;f&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;Z&quot;}<br/>
    ]}}<br/>
  ]}},<br/>
  {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;t&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;Z&quot;}<br/>
]}<br/>
```
