                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1920,                                                AVRO-1887                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      After discussing with yetus community we will need a build.sh for every language.<br/>
Currently it is present for a few and not for all <br/>
{code}<br/>
Busbey-MBA:avro busbey$ find . -name build.sh<br/>
./build.sh<br/>
./lang/c/build.sh<br/>
./lang/c++/build.sh<br/>
./lang/csharp/build.sh<br/>
./lang/js/build.sh<br/>
./lang/php/build.sh<br/>
./lang/ruby/build.sh<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The objective of this task is to create a build.sh for each of the languages.<br/>
<br/>
It might be good idea to refactor the top level build.sh to use the new build.sh scripts like it does for other languages.<br/>
<br/>

