  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to parse a snappy compressed avro file and I am getting the following error:<br/>
<br/>
Unknown Codec in data file: AVRO_CODEC_KEY = snappy<br/>
<br/>
Is there support for snappy compression in Avro c++ ? <br/>
Patch ?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks.
