                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I was testing out a Avro specification for a tree type and the generator crashed. I saw that there was a prior bug (AVRO-1667) that fixed some things in the Java parser. <br/>
<br/>
The same test-case on that bug will cause avrogencpp to segfault.<br/>
<br/>
$ cat tree.avro<br/>
{<br/>
    &quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;name&quot;:&quot;SampleNode&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;org.spf4j.ssdump2.avro&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;fields&quot;:[<br/>
         {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;count&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;int&quot;,&quot;default&quot;:0},<br/>
         {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;subNodes&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:<br/>
            {&quot;type&quot;:&quot;array&quot;,&quot;items&quot;:{<br/>
                &quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;SamplePair&quot;,<br/>
                &quot;fields&quot;:[<br/>
                   {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;method&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:<br/>
                       {&quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Method&quot;,<br/>
                       &quot;fields&quot;:[<br/>
                          {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;declaringClass&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;avro.java.string&quot;:&quot;String&quot;}},<br/>
                          {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;methodName&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;avro.java.string&quot;:&quot;String&quot;}}<br/>
                       ]}},<br/>
                   {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;node&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;SampleNode&quot;}<br/>
                ]<br/>
            }}<br/>
        }<br/>
    ]<br/>
} <br/>
<br/>
$ avrogencpp -i tree.avro -o avro.cpp<br/>
[ segfault ]
