                <tr id="issuerow13022672" rel="13022672" data-issuekey="AVRO-1962" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-1962" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1962">AVRO-1962</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support UUID logical type
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tianxiang Xiong
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tianxiang Xiong
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Nov/16 23:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Nov/16 00:32 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Nov/16 00:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The AVRO-1554 ticket seems to suggest that the issue of representing UUIDs is resolved with [logical types|http://avro.apache.org/docs/1.8.1/spec.html#Logical+Types] in Avro<br/>
1.8.1. However, there is [no UUID logical type in Avro 1.8.1|https://github.com/apache/avro/blob/release-1.8.1/lang/java/compiler/src/main/javacc/org/apache/avro/compiler/idl/idl.jj#L214-L244].<br/>
<br/>
The specification offers several examples of using logical types; decimals<br/>
are represented as:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
{<br/>
<br/>
  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;bytes&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;logicalType&quot;: &quot;decimal&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;precision&quot;: 4,<br/>
  &quot;scale&quot;: 2<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
No examples for UUID are offered, presumably because UUIDs are not supported.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks to [~Yibing]&#39;s confirmation on the mailing list that this is the case.
  </td>
