                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi Guys,<br/>
<br/>
As a suggestion to improve the documentation with more tutorials, I would like to share with you an information about my book [Creating Maintainable APIs](http://www.apress.com/9781484221952). I had devoted Part III of the book to messaging APIs, where I talk about Apache Avro, and how it nicely interplays with Apache Kafka. The book is accompanied with a full source code available at GitHub (see the link to the publisher&#39;s site).<br/>
<br/>
I hope you will find the content useful!<br/>
<br/>
Thanks,<br/>
Ervin
