                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Feb/17 08:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.9.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1975                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Netty version {{3.5.13}} is pretty old. Shall be updated to the latest 3.x release: {{3.10.6}}. <br/>
(Not suggesting to upgrade to 4.x as it requires much more effort due to API incompatibilities.)
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="30/Dec/16 16:34"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2016-12-30T16:34:43+0000">30/Dec/16 4:34 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    19 weeks, 2 days ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      9223372036854775807
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312120">
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312121"><span class="sla-agent-restricted">Restricted to agents</span>
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312328"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312329"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312923"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312326"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312920"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312327"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312921"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312720"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312324"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312325"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310192">      Netty was upgraded from 3.5.13.Final to 3.10.6.Final. After 3.6.0 Netty does not interrupt its worker threads therefore, NettyServer.close() would hang until all the ongoing responder calls finish their job. Normally it means that all the ongoing client requests will be responded before the server stops. It also means that if any of the responder calls are in dead lock NettyServer.close() will never return.
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310191">


    <div class="shorten" id="customfield_12310191-field">
        							<span>Incompatible change</span>			            </div>
</td>
