                SchemaFromJSONData does not invert to_json method
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alexander Hasha
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alexander Hasha
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Jan/17 04:15 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> 06/Jul/17 07:44 </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/17 04:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        python            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A record schema containing a fixed field causes an error when trying to invert `to_json` with `SchemaFromJSONData`.  <br/>
<br/>
To reproduce, using avro-python3==1.8.1 and python 3.6.0<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; test_schema_str = &quot;&quot;&quot;<br/>
... {<br/>
...     &quot;type&quot;        : &quot;record&quot;,<br/>
...     &quot;namespace&quot;   : &quot;dataset&quot;,<br/>
...     &quot;name&quot;        : &quot;test_dataset&quot;,<br/>
...     &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
...         {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;int&quot;   , &quot;name&quot;: &quot;field_1&quot;},<br/>
...         {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;field_2&quot;},<br/>
...         {&quot;default&quot;: null, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;field_3&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: [&quot;null&quot;, &quot;long&quot;]},<br/>
...         { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;features&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;map&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: &quot;double&quot;}},<br/>
...         { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;words&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;array&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: &quot;string&quot;}},<br/>
...         { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;bytes&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;fixed&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Bytes&quot;, &quot;size&quot;: 16}}<br/>
...     ]<br/>
... }<br/>
... &quot;&quot;&quot;<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; from avro.schema import SchemaFromJSONData  <br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; from avro.schema import Parse<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; SchemaFromJSONData(Parse(test_schema_str).to_json())<br/>
Traceback (most recent call last):<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;stdin&gt;&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;redacted&gt;/python3.6/site-packages/avro/schema.py&quot;, line 1254, in SchemaFromJSONData<br/>
    return parser(json_data, names=names)<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;redacted&gt;/python3.6/site-packages/avro/schema.py&quot;, line 1182, in _SchemaFromJSONObject<br/>
    other_props=other_props,<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;redacted&gt;/python3.6/site-packages/avro/schema.py&quot;, line 1061, in __init__<br/>
    fields = make_fields(names=nested_names)<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;redacted&gt;/python3.6/site-packages/avro/schema.py&quot;, line 1173, in MakeFields<br/>
    return tuple(RecordSchema._MakeFieldList(field_desc_list, names))<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;redacted&gt;/site-packages/avro/schema.py&quot;, line 986, in _MakeFieldList<br/>
    yield RecordSchema._MakeField(index, field_desc, names)<br/>
  File &quot;&lt;redacted&gt;/python3.6/site-packages/avro/schema.py&quot;, line 957, in _MakeField<br/>
    names=names,<br/>
